   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WARFSA is part of SADC&apos;s Regional Startegic ction Plan on IWRM. It is hosted by the Institute for Water and Sanitation Developnment (IWSD) based in Harare. The goal is to contribute (through reserach initiatives and caapcity building of researchers) to sustainable development and management of water resources in the SADC region. Gender, HIV/AIDS and MDGs are given special attention.</narrative>
